      "acceptance_criteria": [
        "schema v3の両loop context contractは全operationにskillsとdispatch_skillsを持つ",
        "phase-owned workflow skillはapproved mapping以外に宣言されない",
        "inspectorとreportはreference read-setとphase skill boundaryを分けて返す",
        "validatorはschema v3のfield欠落、不正型、空文字、重複を拒否する",
        "schema v1/v2とllm-wiki context contractの既存挙動を維持する",
        "future operationまたはdispatch先のphase-owned workflow skillをcoordinatorが先読みしない",
        "task-triggered skillは該当phaseだけでon-demandに読み、新しいallowlist、packet field、loaderを追加しない",
        "spec self-review、Issue implementation review、final spec alignment reviewは要件達成、material simplicity、material riskを確認する",
        "routine reviewはMinor、nit、好み、任意改善をfindingとして報告しない",
        "material simplicity findingは具体的なsimpler alternativeを示し、intent_gap / Importantとしてblockingにする",
        "existing hardening、safety、classification boundaryを維持する",
        "skill authoring TDDのRED/GREEN evidenceとfresh full verification evidenceを残す"
      ],
      "dependencies": [],
      "id": "LRSP-001",
      "non_goals": [
        "新しいstandalone skill、generic skill loader、review runtime、finding schemaを作らない",
